  "奥利机场": "Orly Airport",
  "戴高乐机场": "Charles de Gaulle Airport",
  "勒布尔热机场": "Le Bourget Airport",
  "1946 年起承担民航，1961 年南航站楼启用（史实）；重要交通枢纽：范围内可以地下设站与地下穿越（v2.2）": "Civil airport since 1946; the South Terminal opened in 1961 (historical). Major transport hub: underground stations and tunnels are allowed within its grounds (v2.2).",
  "1919 年起为巴黎的民用机场，1977 年停止定期航班（史实）；重要交通枢纽：范围内可以地下设站与地下穿越（v2.2）": "Paris's civil airport from 1919; scheduled flights ended in 1977 (historical). Major transport hub: underground stations and tunnels are allowed within its grounds (v2.2).",
  "机场照常运营（1977 年起为公务航空与航空展），用地不开发": "The airport stays in operation (business aviation and air shows from 1977); its land is not developed",
  "奥利机场，v2.2 地图向南扩大后位于图内。1946 年起承担民航，1961 年 2 月南航站楼启用；需求点设在南、西航站楼一带。": "Orly Airport, inside the map since the v2.2 southward extension. Civil airport since 1946; the South Terminal opened in February 1961. The demand point is near the South and West terminals.",
  "夏尔·戴高乐机场，v2.2 地图向北扩大后位于图内，1974 年 3 月启用。需求点设在第 1 航站楼与 RER B 线机场站一带；1982 年起第 2 航站楼陆续启用。": "Charles de Gaulle Airport, inside the map since the v2.2 northward extension; opened in March 1974. The demand point is near Terminal 1 and the RER B airport station; Terminal 2 opened in stages from 1982.",
  "1976 年迁往南部的帕莱索。": "Moved south to Palaiseau in 1976.",
  "巴黎综合理工学院（帕莱索）": "École polytechnique (Palaiseau)",
  "1976 年由拉丁区迁至帕莱索的萨克雷高地（v2.2 地图向南扩大后位于图内）。": "Moved from the Latin Quarter to the Saclay plateau at Palaiseau in 1976 (inside the map since the v2.2 southward extension).",
  "地图向北扩大到戴高乐机场，向南扩大到奥利机场，向东扩大到马恩拉瓦莱": "The map now extends north to Charles de Gaulle Airport, south to Orly Airport and east to Marne-la-Vallée",
  "萧山机场": "Xiaoshan Airport",
  "萧山国际机场，v2.2 地图向东扩大后位于图内。2000 年 12 月机场启用后产生往返机场的出行；需求点设在两条跑道之间的航站区。": "Xiaoshan International Airport, inside the map since the v2.2 eastward extension. Trips to and from the airport begin when it opens in December 2000; the demand point is in the terminal area between the two runways.",
  "地图向东扩大到萧山机场与大江东一带": "The map now extends east to Xiaoshan Airport and the Dajiangdong area",
  "天河机场": "Tianhe Airport",
  "1995 年 4 月启用，承担武汉的民航。v2.2 地图向北扩大后机场完整位于图内，需求点设在两条跑道之间的航站区，机场跑道一带不开发。": "Opened in April 1995 and serves Wuhan's civil aviation. Since the v2.2 northward extension the whole airport is inside the map; the demand point is in the terminal area between the two runways, and the runway area is not developed.",
  "地图向北扩大，天河机场完整位于图内": "The map now extends north so that Tianhe Airport lies fully inside it",
  "地图向北扩大到同和、京溪，向南扩大到市桥与广州南站": "The map now extends north to Tonghe and Jingxi, and south to Shiqiao and Guangzhou South Station",
