  "霓虹": "Neon",
  "极简": "Minimal",
  "为重要车站选择建筑风格、主题色、公共艺术与标识风格，只改变外观（2.5D 近景的车站模型），不收费、不影响客流。": "Choose an architectural style, theme colour, public art and signage for important stations. Only the look changes (the 2.5D close-up station model); it is free and does not affect ridership.",
  "为重要车站选择建筑风格、主题色、公共艺术与标识风格，只改变外观（2.5D 近景的车站模型），不收费、不影响客流。本站所在片区建议「{x}」。": "Choose an architectural style, theme colour, public art and signage for important stations. Only the look changes (the 2.5D close-up station model); it is free and does not affect ridership. Suggested for this district: {x}.",
  "建筑风格": "Architecture",
  "线路色": "Line colour",
  "主题色": "Theme colour",
  "公共艺术": "Public art",
  "标识风格": "Signage",
  "外观改为随年代，并按当前年代翻新": "Follow the era and renovate in the current era's style",
  "{s} 已按 {y} 年的风格翻新": "{s} renovated in the style of {y}",
