  "车站文化与装修": "Station culture and design",
  "这个方向是主线（显示为线路本名，线路图与列表排在最前）；再点一次取消": "This direction is the main line (shown with the line's own name and listed first); click again to clear",
  "把这个方向设为主线：显示为线路本名，其他方向为支线": "Make this direction the main line: it takes the line's own name and the others become branches",
  "已取消主线方向": "Main-line direction cleared",
  "已把往「{s}」设为主线": "The direction to {s} is now the main line",
  "主线 ✓": "Main ✓",
  "设为主线": "Set as main",
  "设为起点端": "Set as start end",
  "让列车从「{s}」发车：这里到分岔站的一段成为各方向共用的主干": "Trains start from {s}: the section from here to the junction becomes the trunk shared by all directions",
  "已把「{s}」设为起点端": "{s} is now the start end",
  "并线运行：从本线端点沿其他线路的轨道继续开（共用轨道，不另收建设费）": "Run-through: continue from this line's end along another line's track (shared track, no construction cost)",
  "并线终点站": "Run-through terminus",
  "并线": "Run through",
  "主线 · 往 {s}": "Main · to {s}",
  "往 {s}": "To {s}",
  "起点端 · {s}": "Start end · {s}",
  "起点与终点相同": "Start and end are the same",
  "这一段已经是本线的轨道": "This section is already part of the line",
  "（不另收建设费）": "(no construction cost)",
  "贯通、拆开、主线与起点端只改运营组织，不改轨道、不收费；并线沿用既有轨道，不另收建设费（共线区段两线合计最多 {n} 列/时）。都进入草案，确认后生效。": "Through-running, splitting, main line and start end change only how services run: no track changes and no cost. Run-through reuses existing track at no construction cost (shared sections carry at most {n} trains/hour combined). All go into the draft and take effect when confirmed.",
  "Y 字支线：在同一处可设「主线」方向和「起点端」（主干从哪头发车）。": "Y branches: set the main-line direction and the start end (where trunk services start) in the same place.",
  "共线：连接已有轨道的两站、不加转弯点，就免费沿用；端点站在另一条线上时，可一键「并线」沿它的轨道继续开。": "Shared track: connect two stations already joined by track, without bends, to reuse it for free. If the end station is on another line, one click runs your line through along its track.",
  "把第 {k} 个转弯点向弯道内侧移动约 {m} m（箭头方向），最小半径可达约 {r} m。": "Move bend {k} about {m} m towards the inside of the curve (arrow direction); the minimum radius becomes about {r} m.",
  "把第 {k} 个转弯点向弯道外侧移动约 {m} m（箭头方向），最小半径可达约 {r} m。": "Move bend {k} about {m} m towards the outside of the curve (arrow direction); the minimum radius becomes about {r} m.",
  "第 {k} 个转弯点处转角太大，单靠移动它无法放缓到 {r} m：在弯道两侧各加一个转弯点，把一个急弯分成两个缓弯。": "The turn at bend {k} is too sharp to reach {r} m by moving it alone: add a bend on each side to split one sharp curve into two gentle ones.",
  "弯道紧挨「{s}」的站台端：车站两侧约 {m} m 必须是直线，可以在区间中部 Shift+点击加一个转弯点，让线路先直行出站再转弯，或拉开两站距离。": "The curve is right at the platform end of {s}: about {m} m on each side of a station must be straight. Shift+click mid-section to add a bend so the line leaves the station straight before turning, or move the stations further apart.",
  "按建议移动转弯点": "Move bend as suggested",
  "最近约 {m} m 外（箭头方向）可以建站。": "The nearest buildable spot is about {m} m away (arrow direction).",
  "移到可建位置": "Move to buildable spot",
  "附近 600 m 内没有可建站的位置，请换一处选址。": "No buildable spot within 600 m. Choose another site.",
  "问题段长约 {m} m（地图上红色加粗部分）。": "The problem section is about {m} m long (bold red on the map).",
  "把「{a}」沿箭头再移开约 {m} m；也可以把线路直接连到「{b}」，形成同站换乘。": "Move {a} about {m} m further along the arrow, or connect the line directly to {b} to make a shared interchange.",
  "移开 {m} m": "Move {m} m away",
  "站台必须是直线：两侧线路在站内的夹角太小。把车站沿其中一侧的线路方向挪到转弯之外，或在车站两侧各加一个转弯点，让线路先直行进出车站。": "Platforms must be straight: the line turns too sharply through the station. Move the station along one side past the turn, or add a bend on each side so the line enters and leaves straight.",
  "半径约 {r} m · 需 ≥ {n} m": "Radius about {r} m · needs ≥ {n} m",
  "弯道过急 {r} m < {n}": "Too sharp: {r} m < {n}",
  "最小半径 {r} m ✓": "Minimum radius {r} m ✓",
  "移动约 {m} m": "Move about {m} m",
  "基础额度按城市与年代设定，进入模拟增长期后随城市预期财政收入增长；财力系数来自城市经济（上一年地方财政收入）；满意度系数 ×0.6–1.4；历史任务未完成时在 {a} 个月内 ×{b}，动态任务 {c} 个月内 ×{d}（多项叠加最低按 ×{e}）。拨款每月初发放一次，不会重复发放或补发。": "The base allowance depends on city and era and, in the simulated-growth period, grows with expected fiscal revenue; the fiscal multiplier comes from the city economy (last year's local revenue); the satisfaction multiplier is ×0.6–1.4; a missed historical task applies ×{b} for {a} months and a missed dynamic task ×{d} for {c} months (stacked cuts never go below ×{e}). Grants are paid once at the start of each month and are never duplicated or back-paid.",
  "在期限内使日均地铁客运量较当前提高 {p}%（可通过新线、延长线、换乘或调整票价实现）。统计口径：周平均（5 个工作日 + 2 个周末日）。": "Raise average daily metro ridership {p}% above the current level by the deadline (new lines, extensions, transfers or fare changes all help). Basis: weekly average (5 weekdays + 2 weekend days).",
  "连续 3 个月（票款 + 车站商业收入）不低于运营费用的 {a}%（近 3 个月约 {b}%）。可以适当提高票价、开发高客流车站的商业空间，或提高线路客流强度。": "Keep fares plus station commerce at no less than {a}% of operating costs for 3 months in a row (about {b}% over the last 3 months). Raise fares a little, develop commercial space at busy stations, or increase ridership per kilometre.",
  "上月（票款 + 车站商业）/ 运营费用 {a} / 目标 {b}（需连续 {n} 个月，已 {k} 个月）": "Last month (fares + station commerce) / operating costs {a} / target {b} ({n} consecutive months needed, {k} so far)",
  "上月（票款 + 车站商业）/ 运营费用 {a} / 目标 {b}": "Last month (fares + station commerce) / operating costs {a} / target {b}",
  "后果：未来 {n} 个月（含本月）拨款 ×{f}，满意度 {s}": "Consequence: grant ×{f} for the next {n} months (including this one), satisfaction {s}",
  "到期未完成：未来 {n} 个月（含当月）拨款 ×{f}，满意度 {s}": "If unfinished at the deadline: grant ×{f} for the next {n} months (including the current one), satisfaction {s}",
  "未完成：拨款 ×{f}（{n} 个月）": "If unfinished: grant ×{f} ({n} months)",
  "可选挑战：未来 6 个月满意度 −2，拨款不受影响": "Optional challenge: satisfaction −2 for 6 months; grants unaffected",
