  "GDP 好的年份，财力系数高，拨款多": "Good GDP year: higher multiplier, bigger grant",
  "建设专项": "Construction only",
  "只能修地铁": "Metro building only",
  "3 或 6 年到期还本，利率发行时锁定": "Repaid after 3 or 6 years, rate locked at issue",
  "还不上 → 逾期": "Can't pay → overdue",
