  " m，站外步行换乘需在 ": " m. Walking transfers between stations must be within ",
  " m 内。地图外的机场：把线路修到地图边缘的接驳口。风景区一般不能设站，景点约 600 m 内可建地下景区站。": " m. For off-map airports, connect to the access point at the map edge. Scenic areas generally prohibit stations, but underground scenic stations can be built within about 600 m of an attraction.",
  "长安街贯通": "Across Chang'an Avenue",
  "苹果园与国贸之间可以乘地铁直达，沿长安街贯通东西。": "A direct metro journey links Pingguoyuan and Guomao, connecting east and west along Chang'an Avenue.",
  "环环相扣": "Interlocking loops",
  "西直门与东直门都成为三条以上线路交汇的换乘枢纽。": "Xizhimen and Dongzhimen both become interchanges for at least three lines.",
  "，可以浏览目标）。": "; you can browse the targets).",
  "解锁于 ": "Unlocked in ",
  " 分钟，你完成了一轮「规划 → 建设 → 反馈」。接下来可以学换乘、跟随列车和线路图，也可以直接去真实城市。": " minutes. You have completed a plan → build → feedback cycle. Next, learn about interchanges, following trains and network diagrams, or go straight to a real city.",
  " 步 · 约 10 分钟": " steps · About 10 minutes",
  "弯道紧挨「{v0}」的站台端：车站两侧约 {v1} m 必须是直线：在区间中部 Shift+点击加转弯点，或拉开站距。": "The curve is too close to the platform end at “{v0}”. Keep about {v1} m straight on both sides of a station. Shift+click mid-section to add bend points, or increase station spacing.",
  "在期限内使日均地铁客运量较当前提高 {v0}%（周平均）。": "Increase average daily metro ridership by {v0}% within the deadline (weekly average).",
  "存档来自 v{v0}。日常交通改为轻量增量更新，重大建设增加计算，交通任务接近奖惩门槛时复核。旧拥堵任务重新评估，无法由地铁改善的目标调整且不处罚；线网、资金、债务和已结算历史保留，升级当月保护满意度与任务。": "This save is from v{v0}. Daily transport now uses light incremental updates, more calculation for major construction and reviews near task thresholds. Old congestion tasks are reassessed without penalties for targets the metro cannot improve. Networks, finances, debt and past settlements are retained, with satisfaction and task protection during the upgrade month.",
  "存档使用的「{v0}」地图数据为第 {v1} 版，高于当前游戏的第 {v2} 版，请更新游戏后再载入": "This save uses “{v0}” map version {v1}, newer than the current version {v2}. Update the game before loading.",
  "工作日早高峰（7–9 时）与晚高峰（17–19 时）自动按 1× 运行，高峰结束后恢复所选速度；也可点击顶栏的沙漏按钮{v0}切换": "Weekday morning (07:00–09:00) and evening (17:00–19:00) peaks automatically run at 1×, returning to the selected speed afterwards. You can also toggle this with the top-bar hourglass button {v0}.",
  "本城 {v0} / {v1} · ": "This city: {v0} / {v1} · ",
  "最近存档 · {v0} 条线 · {v1} 座车站": "Latest save · {v0} lines · {v1} stations",
  "这些操作只改运营组织，不收费（共线区段两线合计最多 {v0} 列/时）。都进入草案，确认后生效。": "These operational changes are free (a combined limit of {v0} trains/hour on shared track). All changes enter the draft and apply after confirmation.",
  "近一年票款与车站商业收入只覆盖运营费用的 {v0}。可以适度提高票价，或开发高客流车站的商业空间。": "Over the past year, fares and station commerce covered only {v0} of operating costs. Consider a moderate fare increase or developing commercial space at busy stations.",
