  "作者": "Author",
  "送完孩子再去赶公交，{p}的早上永远在跑。地铁要是能修过来，至少能省半小时。": "School run, then a dash for the bus: mornings in {p} are always a race. A metro here would save me half an hour at least.",
  "搬到{p}三年了，朋友问坐地铁怎么来，我都不知道怎么回答。": "Three years in {p} and I still don't know what to say when friends ask which metro station to come to.",
  "加班到十点，从地铁站回{p}还得打车，一个月光打车就花不少。": "Working till ten, then a taxi from the station back to {p}. The taxi bill alone is painful every month.",
  "带我妈去{s}站转了一圈，她说以后去医院不用再等我开车送了。": "Took my mum round {s} station. She says she won't have to wait for me to drive her to hospital any more.",
  "{s}站开通第一天就去打卡了，出口正对着菜市场，太方便了。": "Went to {s} station on opening day. The exit faces the market. So handy.",
  "以前去市区要倒两趟公交，现在从{s}站一坐就到，周末终于愿意出门了。": "Getting downtown used to mean two buses. Now it's one ride from {s}, and I actually go out at weekends.",
  "拖着行李箱从{s}走到{t}，{m} 米走了快十分钟，下次还是打车吧。": "Dragged a suitcase from {s} to {t}: {m} m took almost ten minutes. Taxi next time.",
  "每天在{s}出站换{t}，夏天走一趟一身汗。": "Every day I leave {s} to change to {t}. In summer I'm drenched by the time I get there.",
  "{s}站换乘一会儿上一会儿下，第一次来的人肯定会迷路。": "Changing at {s} is up, down, up again. First-timers are bound to get lost.",
  "八点在{s}站等车，前面排了三层人，眼睁睁看着车开走。": "Eight o'clock at {s}: three rows of people ahead of me, and I watched the train leave without me.",
  "{s}站的早高峰，手机都掏不出来。": "Rush hour at {s}: can't even get my phone out of my pocket.",
  "{l}每天早上从{s}挤到{t}，包都挤变形了。": "Squeezing onto {l} from {s} to {t} every morning. My bag is permanently squashed.",
  "又是被{l}挤成照片的一天。{s}到{t}这段，求多开几趟车。": "Another day pressed flat on {l}. {s} to {t} needs more trains, please.",
  "{l}越坐越喜欢，{s}到{t}从来没迟到过。": "The more I ride {l}, the more I like it. Never been late from {s} to {t}.",
  "下班坐{l}还能有个座，刷两集剧就到家了。": "I get a seat on {l} after work. Two episodes and I'm home.",
  "每天来回 {f}，一个月算下来比午饭还贵。": "{f} a day there and back. Over a month that's more than my lunches.",
  "能不能出个月票？天天来回 {f}，学生党有点吃不消。": "How about a monthly pass? {f} a day for the round trip is a lot on a student budget.",
  "{r}又堵成停车场了，导航说还要四十分钟。": "{r} is a car park again. The sat-nav says forty more minutes.",
  "开车走{r}上班，一路刹车踩到脚酸。": "Driving to work along {r}: my foot aches from braking the whole way.",
  "今天走{r}居然一路绿灯，是不是大家都去坐地铁了？": "Green lights all the way along {r} today. Has everyone switched to the metro?",
  "每次去{x}都要提前一小时出门，路上全靠公交。": "Every trip to {x} means leaving an hour early. It's buses all the way.",
  "新线开通后我把车卖了，每天坐地铁看看书也挺好。": "Sold my car after the new line opened. Reading on the metro every day is rather nice.",
  "说真的，这几年地铁的进步没赶上城市的变化。": "Honestly, the metro hasn't kept up with how much the city has changed.",
  "外地朋友来玩都说这里地铁方便，挺自豪的。": "Friends from out of town always say how easy the metro is here. Makes me proud.",
  "平均每次乘车约 {fu}。": "The average trip costs about {fu}.",
  "同一片的，早上公交站排队排到马路上。": "Same area here. The morning bus queue spills into the road.",
  "我们小区群里天天在问地铁什么时候来。": "Our estate's group chat asks every day when the metro is coming.",
  "前几年就说要规划了，到现在还没动静。": "They said it was being planned years ago. Still nothing.",
  "晚上打车要等半天，司机还不太愿意来。": "At night you wait ages for a taxi, and drivers don't really want to come.",
  "昨天去坐了，站里很凉快！": "Rode it yesterday. Nice and cool inside!",
  "房东已经在说要涨房租了……": "My landlord is already talking about raising the rent…",
  "出口那边能不能多放点共享单车？": "Could we have more share bikes by the exit?",
  "恭喜恭喜，我们那儿还在等。": "Congrats! We're still waiting where I live.",
  "下雨天走这段最难受。": "This walk is the worst when it rains.",
  "第一次来还以为自己走错了。": "First time here I thought I'd gone the wrong way.",
  "换乘通道要是能加个顶棚就好了。": "A roof over the transfer walk would be nice.",
  "老人小孩走这一段真的累。": "It's really tiring for older people and kids.",
  "同款早高峰，我已经练成单脚站立了。": "Same rush hour here. I've mastered standing on one leg.",
  "每天早上都在怀疑人生。": "Every morning I question my life choices.",
  "错峰吧，八点半以后会好一点。": "Try going later. It's better after half past eight.",
  "上周差点被挤下车……": "Last week I nearly got pushed off the train…",
  "确实，比公交靠谱多了。": "True, much more reliable than the bus.",
  "这条线开得很稳，站着都能看书。": "This line is so smooth you can read standing up.",
  "晚上回家还能有座，幸福。": "A seat on the way home in the evening. Bliss.",
  "早上能准点到公司，全靠它。": "It's the only reason I get to work on time.",
  "学生能打折就好了。": "A student discount would be great.",
  "算下来还是比开车便宜，就是每天心疼一下。": "It still works out cheaper than driving. It just stings a little every day.",
  "公司有交通补贴的举个手。": "Hands up if your employer pays for your travel.",
  "多坐几站少坐几站，价格差不了多少。": "A few stops more or less barely changes the price.",
  "同堵，我在车里把早饭都吃完了。": "Same jam here. I finished breakfast in the car.",
  "每天在这条路上能听完一整张专辑。": "I get through a whole album on this road every day.",
  "骑电动车都比开车快。": "An e-bike is faster than a car.",
  "下雨天更别提了。": "Don't even ask about rainy days.",
  "上次去等公交等了半个小时。": "Last time I waited half an hour for the bus.",
  "周末带孩子去，公交挤得不行。": "Took the kids at the weekend. The bus was packed.",
  "修个站吧，真的很需要。": "Please build a station. It's really needed.",
  "附近停车也难，只能打车。": "Parking nearby is hard too, so it's taxis.",
  "确实，这几年变化挺大的。": "True, a lot has changed these past few years.",
  "外地朋友也这么说。": "Friends from out of town say the same.",
  "还有进步空间，继续加油。": "Still room to improve. Keep it up.",
  "希望明年更好。": "Here's hoping next year is even better.",
  "谢谢大家顶，希望规划的人能看到。": "Thanks for the support, everyone. I hope the planners see this.",
  "下次约着一起去打卡！": "Let's all go and try it together next time!",
  "是啊，尤其是拿着东西的时候。": "Yes, especially when you're carrying things.",
  "看来不止我一个人这样……": "Looks like it's not just me…",
  "对，推荐给大家。": "Yes, highly recommend it.",
  "主要是天天都要坐，积少成多。": "It's because I ride every day. It adds up.",
  "明天试试坐地铁。": "I'll try the metro tomorrow.",
  "对，就差一个站。": "Exactly, all it needs is a station.",
  "一起加油。": "Let's keep at it together.",
  "铁路接管": "Rail takeover",
  "已接管": "Taken over",
