  "线路收支": "Line accounts",
  "车站收支与商业开发": "Station accounts & commercial development",
  "收支计算中": "Calculating accounts",
  "线路运营后，这里按月显示每条线路、每座车站的票款、成本与盈亏。": "Once lines are running, monthly fares, costs and profit for every line and station appear here.",
  "月票款": "Monthly fares",
  "车站商业开发": "Station commercial development",
