  " 地铁受损：{v0} 座高架或地面车站、{v1} km 轨道需要维修，维修费 {v2}，线路照常运营。": " Metro damage: {v0} elevated or surface stations and {v1} km of track need repairs costing {v2}; lines keep running.",
