  "桃园机场（西部接驳）": "Taoyuan Airport (western connection)",
  "桃园国际机场（2006 年前称中正国际机场，1979 年启用）在地图西缘以西约 7 km。此处为机场方向的高速公路与轨道交通出图的接驳点。": "Taoyuan International Airport, known as Chiang Kai-shek International Airport before 2006, opened in 1979 about 7 km west of the map. This connection represents airport-bound roads and rail.",
  "2010 年 11 月花博开幕前，步行 15 分钟可到达捷运站的人口不低于 29%。": "Before the November 2010 Flora Expo, bring at least 29% of the population within a 15-minute walk of metro.",
