  "1914 年：地铁覆盖三成三人口": "1914: metro coverage at 33%",
  "一战前，步行 15 分钟可到达地铁站的人口不低于全图人口的 33%。": "Before World War I, bring at least 33% of the map's population within a 15-minute walk of metro.",
