  "新泽西方向铁路的终点站，1907 年建成现有站房（史实）。": "Terminus of the New Jersey railroads; the present building dates from 1907 (history).",
  "白厅渡轮总站": "Whitehall Ferry Terminal",
  "史泰登岛渡轮的曼哈顿总站，市营渡轮 1905 年开航（史实）。": "Manhattan terminal of the Staten Island Ferry, a municipal service since 1905 (history).",
  "大西洋总站": "Atlantic Terminal",
  "牙买加车站": "Jamaica Station",
  "长岛铁路的枢纽，现有站房 1913 年启用（史实）。": "Hub of the Long Island Rail Road; the present building opened in 1913 (history).",
  "港务局巴士总站": "Port Authority Bus Terminal",
  "1939 年 12 月启用（史实）。": "Opened December 1939 (history).",
  "肯尼迪国际机场": "John F. Kennedy International Airport",
  "1948 年以爱德怀德机场启用，1963 年改用现名（史实）。需求点设在中央航站区。": "Opened in 1948 as Idlewild Airport and renamed in 1963 (history). Demand is placed at the central terminal area.",
