  "康尼岛海滩与游乐园": "Coney Island Beach and Amusement Parks",
  "布朗克斯动物园": "Bronx Zoo",
  "布鲁克林植物园": "Brooklyn Botanic Garden",
  "高线公园": "The High Line",
  "法拉盛草地–科罗纳公园": "Flushing Meadows-Corona Park",
