  "中立湾码头": "Neutral Bay Wharf",
  "2000 年的悉尼正在为奥运会做最后的准备，5 月机场线刚刚通车。城铁的放射状干线早已铺满城市，渡轮从环形码头开往港湾各处，悉尼却还没有一条地铁。你要找到铁路和渡轮照顾不到的走廊，修出悉尼的第一条地铁。": "In 2000 Sydney is making its final preparations for the Olympics, and the Airport Line has just opened in May. CityRail's radial lines already cover the city and ferries fan out across the harbour from Circular Quay, yet Sydney has no metro. Find the corridors the trains and ferries miss, and build Sydney's first metro line.",
  "悉尼还没有地铁。真实的西北地铁 2019 年通车；本局由你规划，真实线路不会自动出现。": "Sydney has no metro yet. The real Metro North West opened in 2019; here the plan is yours, and real lines will not appear on their own.",
  "城铁": "CityRail",
  "放射状的城铁网覆盖大部分郊区，按真实线路分走沿线客流。沿线的出行本来就有不错的选择，地铁要更快、更直接才争得到乘客。": "The radial CityRail network covers most suburbs and takes passengers along its real routes. Trips along those lines already have a good option, so the metro must be faster or more direct to win riders.",
  "环形码头的渡轮开往曼利、中立湾、莫斯曼、巴尔曼和帕拉马塔河沿岸。过港的地铁可以吸引一部分渡轮乘客。": "Ferries from Circular Quay run to Manly, Neutral Bay, Mosman, Balmain and along the Parramatta River. A cross-harbour metro can win some of their passengers.",
  "金斯福德·史密斯机场在图内，可以修地下车站；西悉尼国际机场在图外，按 2026 年底通航模拟，要修到地图西缘的接驳口。": "Kingsford Smith Airport is on the map and can take an underground station. Western Sydney International is off the map, opens in late 2026 in this game, and is reached through an access point on the western edge.",
