  "城际与长途列车、长途汽车的总站；城铁的换乘客流由背景交通线路承担。": "Terminus for intercity and long-distance trains and coaches; CityRail transfers are carried by the background lines.",
  "市政厅站": "Town Hall Station",
  "城铁的换乘客流由背景交通线路承担，这里只计站旁的少量接驳出行。": "Suburban rail transfers are carried by the background lines; only a small amount of local access trips is counted here.",
  "悉尼机场": "Sydney Airport",
  "金斯福德·史密斯机场，需求点设在国际航站楼。2000 年 5 月起有机场线（城铁）。": "Kingsford Smith Airport, with demand placed at the international terminal. The Airport Line (CityRail) serves it from May 2000.",
  "西悉尼国际机场（西部接驳）": "Western Sydney International Airport (west access)",
  "西悉尼国际机场在地图西缘以西约 10 km 的巴杰里溪，计划 2026 年底通航（按设定年份模拟）。此处为霍斯利大道与西部快速路方向出图的接驳点。": "Western Sydney International Airport is at Badgerys Creek, about 10 km west of the map edge, and is due to open in late 2026 (simulated at the set date). This is the access point where The Horsley Drive and the M4 leave the map.",
