  "2000 年奥运会场": "2000 Olympic venues",
  "2000 年 9 月 15 日至 10 月 1 日的奥运会，主场馆在霍姆布什湾（史实）。": "The Olympics from 15 September to 1 October 2000, with the main venues at Homebush Bay (history).",
  "悉尼会展中心": "Sydney Convention Centre",
