  "全球金融危机冲击悉尼的金融业，澳大利亚靠财政刺激和资源出口避免了衰退。": "The global financial crisis hits Sydney's finance industry, but fiscal stimulus and resource exports keep Australia out of recession.",
  "千禧双层列车": "Millennium double-deck train",
  "千禧列车": "Millennium",
  "城铁在 2000 年代初订造的双层车，座位多，但上下车慢": "Double-deck cars ordered by CityRail in the early 2000s: lots of seats, but slow to board",
  "沃拉塔双层列车": "Waratah double-deck train",
  "沃拉塔": "Waratah",
  "有空调的新一代双层车，城铁的主力车型": "Air-conditioned new-generation double-deckers, the backbone of the suburban fleet",
  "悉尼地铁 Metropolis（阿尔斯通）": "Sydney Metro Metropolis (Alstom)",
  "单层车厢、全自动运行，座位少、车门宽，上下车快": "Single-deck and driverless, with fewer seats and wide doors for fast boarding",
  "自由建造选项": "Free-build options",
  "2016 年底前，步行 15 分钟可到达地铁站的人口不低于全市人口的 26%，而且汉口、汉阳、武昌三镇都要覆盖到，不能只顾一处。": "By the end of 2016, at least 26% of residents must live within a 15-minute walk of the metro, with coverage across Hankou, Hanyang and Wuchang.",
  "回归前，步行 15 分钟可到达地铁站的人口不低于全市人口的 47%，经营也要站得住：票款加车站商业连续 3 个月达到运营费用的 75%。": "Before the handover, cover 47% of residents within a 15-minute walk of the metro. Fares plus station retail must cover 75% of operating costs for three consecutive months.",
  "悉尼、城铁与渡轮": "Sydney, suburban rail and ferries",
  "新增 2000 年开局的悉尼，带来 3 款本地车型和 13 项历史任务，可用澳元经营。": "Sydney starts in 2000 with three local train models and 13 historical tasks. Manage your system in Australian dollars.",
  "悉尼城铁与渡轮按历史年月开通、停运。在铁路站或码头附近建地铁站，可以吸引换乘。": "Sydney's suburban rail and ferries open and close on their historical dates. Build near stations or wharves to attract transfers.",
  "跨悉尼港需要桥梁或隧道。奥运会带来临时客流，提前修到四处开发热点可获得出资。": "Cross Sydney Harbour by bridge or tunnel. The Olympics bring a temporary surge, and early service to four development areas can earn funding.",
  "地图覆盖黑镇、利物浦与克罗努拉。金斯福德·史密斯机场在图内，西悉尼国际机场于 2026 年 12 月开放西缘接驳。": "The map reaches Blacktown, Liverpool and Cronulla. Kingsford Smith Airport is on the map, and Western Sydney International Airport opens its western gateway in December 2026.",
  "自由建造的起始年份和全图解锁移入弹窗，可点外部或按 Esc 关闭。": "Choose a starting year and unlock the full map in a free-build dialog. Click outside it or press Esc to close.",
  "补齐新加坡、纽约的复合任务，并校正广州扩图后的岗位曲线、深圳地标尺寸与部分口岸卡片位置。": "Singapore and New York gain multi-part tasks. Guangzhou's employment curve, Shenzhen landmark sizes and some border gateway labels have been updated."
