  "这项任务要把地铁修进「{v0}」，可做可不做：完成照常有奖励，未完成不扣拨款和满意度。": "This objective needs the metro inside {v0}, so it is optional: completing it still earns the reward, and missing it costs no grant or satisfaction.",
  "这项任务要把地铁修进风景区，是可选的，未完成没有惩罚。": "This optional objective requires building inside a scenic area. There is no penalty if it expires.",
  "其中运营补贴": "of which operating subsidy",
