  "另有运营补贴：上月票款抵不了运营费用时，政府按财力系数补上差额的 {v0}，随拨款发放。": "There is also an operating subsidy: when last month's fares did not cover operating costs, the government pays {v0} of the gap (times the fiscal factor) with the grant. ",
  "本月已发 {v0}（上月差额 {v1}）。": "Paid this month: {v0} (last month's gap {v1}).",
