  "地图范围（纽约市五个行政区、哈德逊河沿岸与纽瓦克）": "Map area (the five boroughs of New York City, the Hudson waterfront and Newark)",
  "美国实际 GDP 增速": "US real GDP growth",
  "信托公司挤兑引发全国性的金融恐慌，产出明显下降。": "Runs on trust companies set off a national panic and output falls sharply.",
  "美国参战，民用投资让位于军需生产，物价快速上涨。": "The US enters the war, civil investment gives way to military production and prices climb quickly.",
  "流感在战争末期席卷城市，工厂和商店一度停业。": "Influenza sweeps through the cities late in the war, and factories and shops close for a time.",
  "战后物价暴跌，产出和就业急剧下滑，之后很快恢复。": "Prices collapse after the war, output and employment fall steeply, and then recover quickly.",
  "股市崩盘后银行接连倒闭，失业率超过四分之一，金融业和建筑业受创最重。": "Banks fail one after another after the crash, unemployment exceeds a quarter, and finance and construction are hit hardest.",
  "1937–38 年衰退": "1937–38 Recession",
  "财政和货币收紧后经济再次下滑。": "The economy slides again after fiscal and monetary tightening.",
  "战时生产让纽约港和造船业满负荷运转，民用投资几乎停止。": "War production runs the Port of New York and the shipyards at full capacity, and civil investment nearly stops.",
  "战后繁荣": "Postwar Boom",
  "郊区化和消费热潮带动长期增长。": "Suburbanization and a consumer boom drive long-term growth.",
  "纽约财政危机": "New York Fiscal Crisis",
  "纽约市失去发债能力，裁员、削减服务，联邦贷款和州政府的托管机构才把它从破产边缘拉回来。": "The city loses access to credit, lays off workers and cuts services. Federal loans and a state control board pull it back from the edge of bankruptcy.",
  "1981–82 年衰退": "1981–82 Recession",
